---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
import GeoCTA from '../components/GeoCTA.astro'
// Homepage hero photograph (design pass, 2026-09-17): picked from Friday's
// image-ideation run, see projects/apartmentwealthnavigator memory
// project_awn_site_imagery. Caption stays generic: it is a DC-style street,
// not a named block.
import heroImage from '../assets/hero-dc-rowhouses.jpg'

const stats = [
	{ value: '225+', label: 'Owners helped improve NOI' },
	{ value: '75+', label: 'Apartment buildings sold' },
	{ value: '155+', label: 'Refinances positioned' },
	{ value: '35+', label: 'Years in real estate' },
]
---

<Base
	title="Apartment Wealth Navigator | Shafiq Hirani, Apartment NOI and Sale Advisory"
	description="DC, Virginia, and Maryland apartment building owners: find the NOI leak, decide whether to refinance or sell, and get a read on your building."
	canonical="https://apartmentwealthnavigator.com/"
>
	<section class="hero">
		<Image
			class="hero__image"
			src={heroImage}
			alt="A quiet street of red brick rowhouses converted to small apartment buildings in morning light"
			widths={[640, 1024, 1600, 1920]}
			sizes="100vw"
			loading="eager"
			fetchpriority="high"
		/>
		<!-- Silent 5-second loop animated from the same still (1080p, ~5 MB).
		     The still above is the poster and the only thing phones and
		     reduced-motion visitors see; the script below attaches the source
		     only on wider screens with motion allowed, so nothing downloads
		     where it will not play. -->
		<video
			class="hero__video"
			data-src="/video/awn-hero-loop.mp4"
			muted
			loop
			playsinline
			autoplay
			preload="none"
			aria-hidden="true"
			tabindex="-1"
		></video>
		<div class="hero__overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>
		<div class="hero__content">
			<h1>Raise your building's NOI before a lender or a buyer sets its value for you</h1>
			<p>
				I am Shafiq Hirani. I advise small and mid-sized apartment owners in Washington DC,
				Virginia, and Maryland. The work is raising net operating income (NOI), cutting wasted
				expenses, and positioning a building for a stronger refinance or sale.
			</p>
			<GeoCTA />
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="stats">
		<h2 class="visually-hidden">Track record</h2>
		<ul class="stats__grid">
			{
				stats.map((stat) => (
					<li class="stats__card">
						<p class="stats__value">{stat.value}</p>
						<p class="stats__label">{stat.label}</p>
					</li>
				))
			}
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section class="content-block">
		<h2>The market stopped covering the difference</h2>
		<p>Rising values used to hide weak operating performance. Higher interest rates ended that.</p>
		<p>
			Your next lender and your next buyer both price the building on the net operating income it
			produces today, from documents they can verify.
		</p>
		<p>
			A broker who tells you to wait for the market to come back is asking you to sit out a
			repricing that already happened.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="content-block">
		<h2>You are in one of these four situations</h2>
		<p>You own one apartment building or several, in your own name or through an LLC.</p>
		<ul>
			<li>Your loan matures inside the next two years.</li>
			<li>Insurance, taxes, water, and payroll have climbed faster than your rents.</li>
			<li>You are weighing a sale and want to know what the building would sell for on today's numbers.</li>
			<li>The building already runs well and you want the next layer of upside.</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section class="content-block">
		<h2>Three ways I work with owners</h2>
		<div class="services-grid">
			<div>
				<h3><a href="/services/noi">NOI Optimization and Expense Review</a></h3>
				<p>
					Read the income and expense lines a lender or a buyer will price, then work them in an
					order that holds up.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<h3><a href="/services/sale">Sale Readiness and Disposition Advisory</a></h3>
				<p>Get the building, the numbers, and the document file ready before a buyer's underwriter reads them.</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<h3><a href="/services/refinance">Refinance Positioning</a></h3>
				<p>Work the numbers your next lender will size the loan on, while those numbers can still change.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="content-block">
		<h2>Read before you decide</h2>
		<p>
			The <a href="/insights">Insights Hub</a> covers net operating income, refinance timing, sale
			readiness, and the DC-specific version of each question.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="content-block content-block--band">
		<h2>Who reads your numbers</h2>
		<p>
			Commercial Real Estate Advisor and Broker with RE/MAX Distinctive Commercial, licensed in
			Washington DC, Virginia, and Maryland. CCIM, MBA, and Professional Engineer.
		</p>
		<p><a href="/about">More about how I work</a></p>
	</section>

	<section class="content-block content-block--closing">
		<h2>Start with your own numbers</h2>
		<p>Send the property address and your last twelve months of operating statements. I read them before we speak.</p>
		<GeoCTA />
	</section>
</Base>

<style>
	/* Full-bleed photographic hero with the headline over a navy gradient so
	   the copy stays legible on any crop. Image sits under the content and
	   scales with the viewport; the band is shorter on phones. */
	.hero {
		position: relative;
		isolation: isolate;
		min-height: 72vh;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		text-align: center;
		color: var(--color-bg);
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.hero__image {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		object-position: center 40%;
		z-index: -2;
	}

	.hero__video {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		object-position: center 40%;
		z-index: -2;
		opacity: 0;
		transition: opacity 600ms ease;
	}

	.hero__video.is-playing {
		opacity: 1;
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px), (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		.hero__video {
			display: none;
		}
	}

	.hero__overlay {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		background: linear-gradient(
			to top,
			rgba(18, 49, 79, 0.92) 0%,
			rgba(18, 49, 79, 0.62) 45%,
			rgba(10, 13, 20, 0.28) 100%
		);
		z-index: -1;
	}

	.hero__content {
		max-width: 760px;
		padding: var(--space-8) var(--space-4) var(--space-7);
	}

	.hero h1 {
		font-size: var(--text-3xl);
		color: var(--color-bg);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
		text-shadow: 0 1px 12px rgba(10, 13, 20, 0.35);
	}

	.hero p {
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
		color: var(--color-cream);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.hero {
			min-height: 60vh;
		}
	}

	.visually-hidden {
		position: absolute;
		width: 1px;
		height: 1px;
		overflow: hidden;
		clip: rect(0 0 0 0);
	}

	.stats {
		background: var(--color-obsidian);
		padding: var(--space-7) var(--space-4);
	}

	.stats__grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr));
		gap: var(--space-4);
		max-width: 1000px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
	}

	.stats__card {
		border: 1px solid var(--color-slate);
		border-radius: 2px;
		padding: var(--space-4);
		text-align: center;
	}

	.stats__value {
		font-family: var(--font-headline);
		font-size: var(--text-3xl);
		color: var(--color-bg);
		margin: 0 0 var(--space-1);
	}

	.stats__label {
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--color-slate);
		margin: 0;
	}

	.content-block {
		max-width: 720px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-4);
	}

	.content-block--closing {
		text-align: center;
		background: var(--color-cream);
		border-radius: 4px;
	}

	.content-block--band {
		background: var(--color-cream);
		border-radius: 4px;
	}

	.services-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
		gap: var(--space-4);
	}

	.services-grid > div {
		background: var(--color-cream);
		padding: var(--space-4);
		border-radius: 4px;
	}
</style>

<script>
	import { attachLoopVideos } from '../lib/loop-video'
	attachLoopVideos()
</script>
